    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "z9k7zy1",
      "content": "<strong>3.5  Reading Comprehension — Strategy</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "rz4t1ba",
      "type": "numberedList",
      "items": [
        "Read the questions FIRST before reading the passage. This tells you what to look for.",
        "Skim the passage for the main idea and structure (introduction, body, conclusion).",
        "Scan for specific information when answering factual questions.",
        "For vocabulary-in-context questions, look at the surrounding sentences.",
        "For inference questions, choose the answer most directly supported by the passage.",
        "Avoid answers that are true in general but not stated or implied in the passage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mcrwaf6",
      "content": "<strong>3.6  Error Spotting — Common Errors</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "lf91icz",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Error Type</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Incorrect</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Correct</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Subject–verb agreement</p>",
            "<p>The committee are divided</p>",
            "<p>The committee is divided</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Article usage</p>",
            "<p>She is an university student</p>",
            "<p>She is a university student</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Tense consistency</p>",
            "<p>He came and goes</p>",
            "<p>He came and went</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Preposition</p>",
            "<p>He is good in maths</p>",
            "<p>He is good at maths</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Pronoun reference</p>",
            "<p>Each student must do their work</p>",
            "<p>Each student must do his/her work</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Modifier placement</p>",
            "<p>Running quickly, the bus was missed</p>",
            "<p>Running quickly, he missed the bus</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Double negative</p>",
            "<p>I did not see nobody</p>",
            "<p>I did not see anybody</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Comparison</p>",
            "<p>She is more better than him</p>",
            "<p>She is better than him</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Redundancy</p>",
            "<p>Return back to office</p>",
            "<p>Return to office</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Gerund vs Infinitive</p>",
            "<p>He avoided to speak</p>",
            "<p>He avoided speaking</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
